  "description": "Tait TM8100/TM8200 CCDI serial control: per-frame RSSI in dBm, hardware carrier-sense (DCD) events, transmitter keying, the SDM side channel, and radio telemetry (PA temperature, forward/reverse power). Implements the M0LTE.Rig IRadioControl abstraction and, via TaitRigControl, the M0LTE.Rig IRigControl station-control seam (PTT + relative RF-power meter). Source: github.com/M0LTE/M0LTE.Tait.Ccdi.",
